exceed in height 30 feet or two <strong><em>stories</em></strong>, whichever is less.</span></p>","plainText":"However, in accordance with the provisions of Section 32-42 (Location Within Buildings), in C1, C2 or C3 Districts, no commercial building or portion thereof occupied by uses listed under Use Groups VI through X shall exceed in height 30 feet or two stories, whichever is less."},{"id":"zr-17764-block-007","kind":"html","html":"<p><span>In C4-1 or C8-1 Districts, for <strong><em>community facility buildings</em></strong> or <strong><em>buildings</em></strong> used for both <strong><em>community facility</em></strong> <strong><em>use</em></strong> and <strong><em>commercial</em></strong> <strong><em>use</em></strong>, the maximum height above <strong><em>street line</em></strong> shall be 35 feet or three <strong><em>stories</em></strong>, whichever is less.</span></p>","plainText":"In C4-1 or C8-1 Districts, for community facility buildings or buildings used for both community facility use and commercial use, the maximum height above street line shall be 35 feet or three stories, whichever is less."},{"id":"zr-17764-block-008","kind":"html","html":"<p class=\"center-align\"><span><a href=\"../../../assets/zr-4fc8b3d3c18f2e10-Zoning-Resolutions-33-442.0.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Zoning Resolutions <a class='sec-link-inline' target='_blank' href='/article-iii/chapter-3#33-442'><span>33-442</span></a>.0\" src=\"../../../assets/zr-4fc8b3d3c18f2e10-Zoning-Resolutions-33-442.0.png\" title=\"\"></a></span></p>","plainText":""},{"id":"zr-17764-block-009","kind":"html","html":"<p class=\"center-align\"><span>ALTERNATE SKY EXPOSURE PLANE</span></p>","plainText":"ALTERNATE SKY EXPOSURE PLANE"},{"id":"zr-17764-block-010","kind":"html","html":"<p class=\"center-align\"><span>(<a class=\"sec-link-inline\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://zr.planning.nyc.gov/article-ii/chapter-3#23-736\" data-permitext-zr-source=\"https://zr.planning.nyc.gov/article-ii/chapter-3#2